items.CB_Crimson_Cowl.name=Cowl of the Crimson Oath
items.CB_Crimson_Cowl.description=A narrow crimson seam watches from beneath this midnight hood. Its angular mask bears the Brotherhood's first vow: speak no name before the work is done. Blackened fittings honor the cruel elegance of the Daedric Princes; the face behind them belongs only to the oath.\n\nRequires primary Assassin or its ascensions to equip. Secondary Assassin alone does not qualify.\n+18 Health, +1 Stamina. Physical/Projectile resistance: 9%; Poison resistance: 8%.\nAssassin attributes: +4 Precision (critical chance points), +4 Ferocity (critical damage points). Attributes require this piece in its correct slot and unbroken; no full set required.
items.CB_Oathbound_Shroud.name=Shroud of the Unseen Hand
items.CB_Oathbound_Shroud.description=Graphite plates overlap a heart of crimson cloth, each talon-shaped seam bound by a different broken promise. A faceted blood-red stone seals the covenant at the breast. The Brotherhood calls it a shroud because its wearer has already surrendered the life that came before.\n\nRequires primary Assassin or its ascensions to equip. Secondary Assassin alone does not qualify.\n+36 Health, +1 Stamina. Physical/Projectile resistance: 16%; Poison resistance: 12%.\nAssassin attributes: +6 Life Force (Health). Attributes require this piece in its correct slot and unbroken; no full set required.
items.CB_Silence_Grasp.name=Grasp of the Last Whisper
items.CB_Silence_Grasp.description=Recessed crimson channels trace these articulated gauntlets like the patient venom in the Brotherhood's twin daggers. Stitched leather closes beneath forged knuckle plates. Their fingers remember the final words of every oathbreaker; their keeper never repeats them.\n\nRequires primary Assassin or its ascensions to equip. Secondary Assassin alone does not qualify.\n+16 Health, +1 Stamina. Physical/Projectile resistance: 7%; Poison resistance: 4%.\nAssassin attributes: +8% Strength (melee scaling). Attributes require this piece in its correct slot and unbroken; no full set required.
items.CB_Nightstalker_Strides.name=Strides of the Dread Stalker
items.CB_Nightstalker_Strides.description=Layered greaves carry the same hooked lines as the daggers sworn beside them. Dark leather, inset rubies and a divided crimson hem mark the Brotherhood's hunters. Beyond the gates of Oblivion, even the longest road is measured one condemned step at a time.\n\nRequires primary Assassin or its ascensions to equip. Secondary Assassin alone does not qualify.\n+26 Health, +3 Stamina. Physical/Projectile resistance: 13%; Poison resistance: 6%.\nAssassin attributes: +8% Haste (movement speed). Attributes require this piece in its correct slot and unbroken; no full set required.
